# Gumtree UK

> Gumtree is a UK local classifieds marketplace for buying and selling items nearby, and for finding cars, property, jobs, services, and community listings. Founded in 2000, it is one of the UK's largest and longest-running online classifieds platforms. Free to post for most categories, easy to use.

