## Circular economy and sustainability

The vast majority of trade on Gumtree is between private individuals selling secondhand goods and services, enabling local communities to effortlessly participate in the circular economy. By facilitating the reuse and resale of goods locally, Gumtree helps reduce waste and extends the useful life of products.

